    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "fair enough. but if the dissent's view is just based on a \"liberal view\" of rights that doesn't actually align with the historical text originalism focus, isn't it basically a legally unsound argument compared to the majority's reasoning?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
